# Golden G-M2-2: D19 smart richness across degrees in C major.
# C -> Cmaj7 (I), F -> Fmaj7 (IV), G -> G7 (V), B -> Bm7b5 (vii).
# Each change releases the previous voicing on the same tick, and the
# NoteOffs must sort before the new NoteOns (D29).
key C major
port open out virt as synth
chord out synth
@0   play C
@96  play F
@192 play G
@288 play B
@384 chord stop
advance 480
quit
